 "description": "A snowman of three hand-rolled snowballs on a drift of snow, with coal eyes, a coal smile and coal buttons, a carrot nose, stick arms with twigs, a knitted scarf with a hanging end, and a hat: a top hat with a band, a zinc bucket or a knitted beanie with a pompom. Height, the hat, the scarf, the arms and how far they are raised, the buttons, the nose and how far it has melted are parameters. The head turns about its base and the arms pivot where they go into the body.",
